[I] COIN-OR Open Solver Interface

[T] Osi (Open Solver Interface) provides an abstract C++ base class to a
[T] generic linear programming solver, along with derived classes for
[T] specific solvers such as Clp, GLPK and commercial ones. Programs written
[T] to the Osi standard can be linked to any solver with an Osi interface,
[T] with rudimentary integer programming support.

[U] https://www.coin-or.org/

[A] COIN-OR Foundation
[M] andrei32

[C] base/library
